        {
          "definition": "The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/phenomenon\" title=\"phenomenon\">phenomenon</a> of making an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/unplanned\" title=\"unplanned\">unplanned</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fortunate\" title=\"fortunate\">fortunate</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/discovery\" title=\"discovery\">discovery</a> through a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/combination\" title=\"combination\">combination</a> of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/unexpected\" title=\"unexpected\">unexpected</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/circumstance\" title=\"circumstance\">circumstances</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/insightful\" title=\"insightful\">insightful</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/recognition\" title=\"recognition\">recognition</a>."
